            <div xml:id="errata">

                <pb facs="d333-03" n="3" sameAs="frus:frus1969-76ve05p1/d333-03"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following changes have been made to the online version of <ref
                        target="frus:frus1969-76ve05p1">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1969–1976, Volume E–5, Part
                        1, Documents on Sub-Saharan Africa, 1969–1972</ref>.</p>
                <list type="simple">
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">1. <ref target="#d213">Document 213</ref>. </hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>After publication, it was discovered that the text and facsimile page
                        images for Document 213 were in error and were a duplication of <ref
                            target="#d216">Document 216</ref>. Editors supplied the correct text and
                        page images. (Date of correction: October 11, 2019)</item>
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">2. <ref target="#d289">Document 289</ref>. </hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>After publication, it was discovered that the text and facsimile page
                        images for Document 289 were in error and were a duplication of <ref
                            target="#d288">Document 288</ref>. Editors supplied the correct text and
                        page images. (Date of correction: November 5, 2019)</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
